      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Two additional notes:\n\n1. Even without our patch, when a user picks up a object it (obviously) resolves the issue for the new joiner, and the object teleports from its spawn location to the owner's hand.\n\n2. Strangely, the issue seems to only impact specific object owners. It's not uncommon for all objects owned by a specific user to not properly sync to late joiners, but objects owned by other owners do sync to late joiners. The issue seems well divided based on the current object owner. I'm unsure if the issue only ever impacts one owner, or if there can be multiple. I'm unsure if the issue is related to if the object owner is the master.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
